.TH RFID-ARM-NEXT-SCRIPT 1 "2026-07-28" "GWAY local tools" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
rfid-arm-next-script \- bind the next distinct RFID card to a script
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rfid-arm-next-script
.B --script
.I FILE
.B --display-name
.I TEXT
.B --label-line1
.I TEXT
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Arms the local RFID system, waits for the next distinct card scan, registers
that card as a directory plus sidecar action, seeds runner state to avoid
immediate retriggers, and restarts the mode runner.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI --script " FILE"
Script to bind.
.TP
.BI --display-name " TEXT"
Short LCD display name while armed.
.TP
.BI --label-line1 " TEXT"
First card label line.
.TP
.BI --label-line2 " TEXT"
Second card label line.
.TP
.BI --timeout " SECONDS"
Maximum wait time.
.TP
.B --force
Replace existing binding.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rfid-register (1),
.BR rfid-clear-current (1)
